<main class="pc" data-product-core="configuration"><p class="pc-kicker">CRANIO SYSTEMS / 02 / Configuration</p><h1>Kopforientierung</h1><p class="pc-lead">Winkel dienen der Illustration; keine individuelle Messung.</p><div class="pc-steps" role="navigation" aria-label="CRANIO"><a href="../your-cranium/">01 · Personal Navigator</a><a href="../configuration/" aria-current="page">02 · Configuration</a><a href="../potential/">03 · Potential</a></div><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-three"><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Vorderansicht</p><h3>Seitneigung</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 240 250" role="img" aria-label="C0–C1"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".25"><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="97"/><path d="M120 15V235M15 125H225" stroke-dasharray="4 6"/></g><path d="M72 230Q90 197 106 185L111 125H129L134 185Q150 197 168 230" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".5" stroke-width="2"/><g class="pc-rotate" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M120 25Q65 25 65 75Q65 105 108 119L120 130L132 119Q175 105 175 75Q175 25 120 25Z"/><path d="M77 77H163M120 30V121" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="6" fill="var(--pa)"/><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="13" stroke="var(--pa)" fill="none"/></svg><label for="pc-angle-0">Seitneigung <output for="pc-angle-0">0°</output></label><input data-angle id="pc-angle-0" type="range" min="-15" max="15" step="1" value="0" data-js hidden></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Draufsicht</p><h3>Drehung</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 240 250" role="img" aria-label="C0–C1"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".25"><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="97"/><path d="M120 15V235M15 125H225" stroke-dasharray="4 6"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="36" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"/><g class="pc-rotate" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><ellipse cx="120" cy="125" rx="64" ry="82"/><path d="M109 48L120 31L131 48M120 45V205" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="6" fill="var(--pa)"/><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="13" stroke="var(--pa)" fill="none"/></svg><label for="pc-angle-1">Drehung <output for="pc-angle-1">0°</output></label><input data-angle id="pc-angle-1" type="range" min="-15" max="15" step="1" value="0" data-js hidden></div><div class="pc-card"><p class="pc-kicker">Seitenansicht</p><h3>Vor-/Rückneigung</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 240 250" role="img" aria-label="C0–C1"><g fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".25"><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="97"/><path d="M120 15V235M15 125H225" stroke-dasharray="4 6"/></g><path d="M72 230Q90 197 106 185L111 125H129L134 185Q150 197 168 230" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" opacity=".5" stroke-width="2"/><g class="pc-rotate" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path d="M120 30Q64 30 70 86L87 110L111 120L120 130L143 111L162 102L153 88L166 78L152 57Q142 30 120 30Z"/><path d="M120 35V124M77 83H158" stroke-dasharray="4 5"/></g><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="6" fill="var(--pa)"/><circle cx="120" cy="125" r="13" stroke="var(--pa)" fill="none"/></svg><label for="pc-angle-2">Vor-/Rückneigung <output for="pc-angle-2">0°</output></label><input data-angle id="pc-angle-2" type="range" min="-15" max="15" step="1" value="0" data-js hidden></div></div><div class="pc-actions"><button type="button" data-reset data-js hidden>Zurücksetzen</button></div><p class="pc-note">Winkel dienen der Illustration; keine individuelle Messung.</p><a class="pc-link" href="../c0-c1/">C0–C1 ↗</a></section><section class="pc-section"><div class="pc-actions"><a class="pc-button primary" href="../potential/">Weiter · Potential ↗</a><a class="pc-button" href="../start/">Anliegen besprechen</a></div><details class="pc-legacy"><summary>Bisherige Inhalte</summary><div class="wrap"><article class="article"><div class="eyebrow">CRANIO · Konfiguration</div><h2>Konfiguration — CRANIO</h2><p class="lead">Konfiguration beschreibt den Zustand eines Systems durch die Beziehungen zwischen seinen Teilen.</p><h2>Why configuration matters</h2><p>A system is not defined only by its individual parts. Configuration describes how those parts relate, align, distribute load and change together.</p><h2>From experience to configuration</h2><p>Experience gives the human entry point. Observation makes the state visible. Configuration gives the system a precise way to describe what is happening without prematurely assigning a cause.</p><div class="actions"><a class="btn dark" href="../experience/">Explore experience</a><a class="btn" href="../method/">Method</a></div></article></div></details></section></main>